al thor king valkyrie is  what it says here and of course she is  the king of asgard now not queen but  king korg of course is back as expected  and hoped for and then there is gore the  god butcher now what's really  interesting about this is that if you  look closely enough we can see on the  front of the ship it says a gear asgard  tours now there's two parts to this that  make it really really interesting one is  the first part agar now this is probably  the name of the boat and it makes sense  because in marvel comics a gear was the  god of the seas pretty much like neptune  except this is the norse god ager so it  would make sense that they named their  ship after the god of the sea but it  also says asgard tours now remember  asgard is now on earth and people are  aware of asgardians because thor is  actually quite famous we found this out  during thor ragnarok in the beginning  where people came up to him and asked to  take his picture and they also knew that  thor and jane broke up so thor is kind  of celebrity so it would make sense that  people would actually go to asgard to  kind of be tourists there and it looks  like asgard has kind of embraced it a  little bit after all they're probably  going to need a little bit of money at  least so that would probably be a pretty  decent way of making money giving tours  now all of this is fantastic it's great  to learn a lot about this movie and this  also means that the trailer shouldn't be  that far away doctor strange in the  multiverse of madness comes out a month  before thor love and thunder and they  gave us the first teaser trailer for  multiverse of madness about five months  before the movie is actually coming out  and that is kind of where we're at right  now with thor love and thunder we're  about five months away because it comes  out july 8th of 2022 so we're actually  less than five months away from the  release of thor love and thunder now if  you combine that fact with the fact that  marvel is now officially releasing  things like this toys legos official art  for the movie this means that promotion  for love and thunder is about to ramp up  this is an extremely good sign that  they're getting ready to release that  trailer and we just got the big  promotion for doctor strange and the  multiverse of madness they released the  full official trailer during the super  bowl or i should say before the super  bowl but that was the one thing that it  looked like marvel studios was waiting  on because they weren't going to give us  a trailer for love and thunder before we  got the official one for doctor strange  but we have that now promotions are  beginning to start and we have less than  five months until the movie comes out so  i would expect the first teaser trailer  relatively soon if marvel sticks to the  same thing they've been doing we  hopefully get it within a month but as  always if i hear anything about when to  expect that first teaser trailer i'll of  course do a video on it letting  everybody know in the meantime let me  know what you all think about these new  reveals through these new toys what do  you think of the new costumes and what  do you think about tooth nasher and  tooth grinder coming to the mcu let me  know your thoughts in the comments down  below don't forget to like the video and  subscribe so you can stay up to date on  all things relating to the mcu for live  updates you can follow me on instagram  and twitter and as always thank you all  so much for watching woof

